  "sn22.43:1.2": "This was famously one of the last teachings of the Buddha (<a href='https://suttacentral.net/dn16/en/sujato#2.26.1'>DN 16:2.26.1</a>). ",
  "sn22.43:1.3": "Compare the Bodhisatta’s reflection at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn12.10/en/sujato'>SN 12.10</a>. | Readings vary, but surely for <i lang='pi' translate='no'>yoni upaparikkhitabbā</i> we should accept the variant <i lang='pi' translate='no'>yoniso</i> (“rationally”; literally “by way of source”), as also found at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn22.95/en/sujato#2.1'>SN 22.95:2.1</a>. ",
  "sn22.43:2.1": "",
  "sn22.43:2.2": "",
  "sn22.43:2.3": "See note on <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn22.1/en/sujato#9.3'>SN 22.1:9.3</a>. ",
